[Music]  as a child renee  you made us both realise you had a  spirit and determination in you like no  other  we knew  that we wouldn't have to worry about you  achieving  whatever you put your mind to  [Music]  add a child david was everything we  could have asked for  and nothing has actually changed  we couldn't be prouder of the man that  he has grown into  [Music]  when a young man  is as well-mannered  consider it  caring  and spoils his girl like david  you know he has come from a beautiful  loving family  [Music]  david and renee  we want you to know that we will always  be there for you  we want you to take good care  of each other  and always respect and support one  another  [Music]  renee  a decade ago without a moment's notice  you confidently turned around with your  piercing blue eyes  and changed my life forever  what was meant to be a typical  orientation day turned into the best day  of my life  as you turned around  the entire world faded away  [Music]  i blindly followed you that entire day  as i felt overwhelming unexplainable  emotions  it was your childlike excitement for  life  your genuine love and compassion for  people  and your dedication for what you  believed in that made me feel certain  around you  [Music]  not only were you this beautiful  confident person that turned into my  life  but you also changed it forever  david  [Music]  i remember that feeling i had back in  2012  a feeling of connection  whether it's the small gestures  like  asking me if i want a massage every  night before bed  [Music]  or the big gestures  like your elaborate six-month proposal  you make me  feel prioritized  safe  empowered  and inordinately proud to be by your  side  [Music]  thank you for choosing me  i love you  [Music]

